    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好啊，我是小熊，</span></p><p><span>今天和好久不见的小路大夫和大家分享一下怎么筛选中医在线复诊平台看病。</span></p><p><span>线上交友有风险，线上看病更要谨慎。本期不涉及任何广告推荐内容，任何节目内出现的在线复诊平台均为示例。</span></p><p><span>大家在选择在线复诊平台的时候仍需自行鉴别。</span></p><blockquote><p><span>🎧听友群：zrkf006</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>🍑官方店铺：</span><a href="https://shaibei.taobao.com/" data-url="https://shaibei.taobao.com/"><span>晒背研究所</span></a><span>（点击直达）</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>视频号：晒背研究所</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3IiNmjpJK1JvCNvy6Zr_13DLlo.jpg"></figure><p><span>本期大夫：</span></p><p><span>@李晓路 （小红书：751225864）</span></p><p><span>主持人：</span></p><p><span>@小熊Deploy</span></p><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">00:01:18</a> 目前中医疗资源不均的现状</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">00:02:31</a> 在线复诊的成本优势</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">00:03:09</a> 都是哪些医生在线上</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">00:03:54</a> 首诊建议 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">00:04:26</a> 避坑指南</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">00:06:23</a> 对患者来说不同平台有啥差异？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">00:08:03</a> 为什么我们在短视频里找不到适合的医生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">00:12:39</a> 不良团队作业链条 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">00:14:07</a> 视频与看病分离</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">00:14:46</a> 药品质量隐患 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">00:22:02</a> 不要盲目相信“首页推荐”机制</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">00:30:26</a>如何与医生打好配合，完成一次高质量的远程诊断</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">00:34:03</a> 通过元整处理急症的一个故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2481">00:41:21</a> 首次抓药建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2641">00:44:01</a> 为什么摸不到脉也能看病</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2969">00:49:29</a> 诊断权重排序 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3091">00:51:31</a> 舌象拍摄指南 </span></p><p></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWGYtmI32ZpjLUQhzc8LpJdKxWf.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsVEAHi471VKQoNBx1Y6XI-7mp82.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnw5q0ZcFXHeWL93nfeVcHtdou3D.jpg"></figure><p><span>祝大家身体健康。</span></p>]]></description>
